hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"235","[AI-translation] Haddasana Hannad bin As-Sari, qala: Haddasana Waki', 'an Shu'bah, 'an Abi At-Tayyah, 'an Anas bin Malik, qala: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamare saath itne mil jul kar guzarte the ke mere ek chote bhai se farmate: Aye Aba Umair! Nughair ka kya hua?"
"236","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abbas bin Muhammad Ad-Duri, qala: Haddasana Ali bin Al-Hasan bin Shaqiq, qala: Anba'ana Abdullah bin Al-Mubarak, 'an Usamah bin Zaid, 'an Sa'id Al-Maqburi, 'an Abi Hurairah, qala: Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah! Aap ham se mazaq karte hain. Farmaya: Main haq ke ilawa kuch nahi kehta."
"237","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaibah bin Sa'id, qala: Haddasana Khalid bin 'Abdullah, 'an Humaid, 'an Anas bin Malik, ke ek shakhs ne Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se sawari mangi, to aap ne farmaya: Main tumhe oont ke bachay par sawar karunga. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah! Oont ke bachay ka main kya karunga? To aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya oontiyan hi oont to deti hain?"
"238","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ishaq bin Mansoor, qala: Haddasana Abdur Razzaq, qala: Haddasana Ma'mar, 'an Sabit, 'an Anas bin Malik, ke ek aadmi badiya walo mein se tha jis ka naam Zahir tha, aur woh Nabi Sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko badiya se tohfa pesh karte, toh Nabi Sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab woh nikalna chahte toh unhein zar-e-raah dete. Aur Nabi Sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Zahir hamare badiya wale hain aur hum unke shehri hain. Aur unhein Sallallahu alaihi wasallam se muhabbat thi, aur woh shakhs bad-surat thay. Ek din Nabi Sallallahu alaihi wasallam unke paas aaye jab woh apna saama bech rahe thay, aur unhein pichhe se gale laga liya aur unhein nazar nahi aaya. Toh unhone kaha: Yeh kaun hai? Mujhe chhor do. Phir mud kar dekha toh Nabi Sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko pehchaan liya. Phir jab unhein pehchaan liya toh apni peeth Nabi Sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke seene se lagaye rahne mein koi kasar na rakhi. Toh Nabi Sallallahu alaihi wasallam kehne lage: Yeh ghulaam kaun khareedega? Toh unhone kaha: Ya Rasoolallah! Pus Allah ki qasam aap mujhe bekaar painge. Toh Nabi Sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Lekin Allah ke paas tu bekaar nahi hai, ya farmaya: Tu Allah ke paas qeemti hai."
"239","[AI-translation] Hamein Abd bin Humaid ne hadith bayan ki, unhone farmaya: Hamein Mus'ab bin Miqdam ne hadith bayan ki, unhone farmaya: Hamein Mubarak bin Fazala ne hadith bayan ki, Hasan se, unhone kaha: Ek budhi aurat Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas aayi aur arz ki: Ya Rasoolallah! Dua farmaye ke Allah mujhe jannat mein dakhil kare. Aap sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ya fulan ki amma! Jannat mein budhi aurat nahi jati. Unhone kaha: Wo rote hue palat gayi. Toh Aap sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Usey bata do ke wo budhi hokar jannat mein nahi jayegi. Be-shak Allah ta'ala farmata hai: Hum ne unhe nai tarah paida kiya, aur unhe kunwariyan bana diya, mohabbat waliyan, hum umr waliyan."
"240","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ali bin Hujr, qala: Haddasana Sharik, 'an Al-Miqdam bin Shuraih, 'an abihi, 'an 'Aisha, qalat: Un se poocha gaya: Kya Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam kisi shair ki tamseel karte the? Unhon ne farmaya: Wo Ibn-e-Rawaha ke shair ki tamseel karte the, aur unke is qaul ki tamseel karte the: ""Tujhe khabrein pahunchata hai wo jise zira nahin diya gaya tha."
"241","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hadith bayan ki, keh: Hamein Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi ne hadith bayan ki, keh: Hamein Sufyan Al-Thawri ne hadith bayan ki, Abdul Malik bin Umair se, keh: Hamein Abu Salamah ne hadith bayan ki, Abu Hurairah se, keh: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Shayr ki sab sachi baat jo usne kahi wo Labid ki baat hai: ""Aala kullu shay'in ma khala Allahu batil"", aur Umayya bin Abi Al-Salt qareeb the ke Musalman ho jate."
"242","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna ne hadith bayan ki, keh: Hamein Muhammad bin Jafar ne hadith bayan ki, keh: Hamein Shu'bah ne hadith bayan ki, Al-Aswad bin Qais se, Jundab bin Sufyan Al-Bajali se, keh: Ek paththar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki ungli par laga toh us mein se khoon nikal aaya, toh Aap (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tu ungli hi to hai, khoon bahi, aur Allah ki raah mein jo kuch mila. Hamein Ibn Abi Umar ne hadith bayan ki, keh: Hamein Sufyan bin Uyaynah ne hadith bayan ki, Al-Aswad bin Qais se, Jundab bin Abdullah Al-Bajali se, iski misl."
"243","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna ne hadith bayan ki, keh: Hamein Muhammad bin Jafar ne hadith bayan ki, keh: Hamein Shu'bah ne hadith bayan ki, Al-Aswad bin Qais se, Jundab bin Sufyan Al-Bajali se, keh: Ek paththar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki ungli par laga toh us mein se khoon nikal aaya, toh Aap (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tu ungli hi to hai, khoon bahi, aur Allah ki raah mein jo kuch mila. Hamein Ibn Abi Umar ne hadith bayan ki, keh: Hamein Sufyan bin Uyaynah ne hadith bayan ki, Al-Aswad bin Qais se, Jundab bin Abdullah Al-Bajali se, iski misl."
